00:16:23.148 --> 00:16:26.118
like it was just generally
a terrible existence for everyone

00:16:26.118 --> 00:16:27.853
while they were still under
federal authority.

00:16:27.853 --> 00:16:29.355
It sounds like the federal military

00:16:29.355 --> 00:16:33.392
captured her brother and tortured him
