00:16:37.096 --> 00:16:40.733
of her brother to Phaedra, Henry and Sam,
huge characters from the games.

00:16:40.733 --> 00:16:42.134
They changed their story a little.

00:16:42.134 --> 00:16:44.670
I'll talk about that
