00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:45.337
On the show, though,

00:16:45.337 --> 00:16:47.806
the ideas that Phaedra
would have threatened Sam's life

00:16:47.806 --> 00:16:50.442
and Henry's whole thing,
like his whole reason for existence.

00:16:50.442 --> 00:16:55.214
As Joel says, protecting his brother Tommy
is to protect Sam, his younger brother.

00:16:55.214 --> 00:16:56.982
So he would have had no problem giving up

00:16:56.982 --> 00:16:59.318
Kathleen's brother
to protect his little brother.

00:16:59.318 --> 00:17:01.653
And in the wake of her brother's death,
Kathleen is just looking

00:17:01.653 --> 00:17:05.424
for revenge on Henry
and is going to crazy lengths to get it.

00:17:05.424 --> 00:17:07.393
One of the reasons why
