00:17:07.393 --> 00:17:10.529
the show is just to build out the Hunter
storyline like they did this whole side

00:17:10.529 --> 00:17:13.599
storyline where they change
Henry and Sam's backstory

00:17:13.599 --> 00:17:17.669
just so that more is going on during this
big Kansas City Hunters encounter

00:17:17.669 --> 00:17:20.973
in the game, it was a little bit simpler,
but it was the same basic premise

00:17:20.973 --> 00:17:24.343
whole bunch of hunters, inner city,
they have to make it through the city.

00:17:24.343 --> 00:17:25.110
They also want to use.

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:27.579
Kathleen is a more complicated
kind of antagonist.

00:17:27.579 --> 00:17:31.483
She's somewhat justified in wanting
