00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:53.372
Like, Oh, he wanted to protect his family.

00:17:53.372 --> 00:17:55.307
Like I care about my family.

00:17:55.307 --> 00:17:56.275
Only for a second, though.

00:17:56.275 --> 00:17:58.377
Then she snaps back to cold, hard revenge.

00:17:58.377 --> 00:17:58.844
The hunters

00:17:58.844 --> 00:18:01.914
